d progress bars for top countries. I\'ve designed the export feature for a CSV report to be downloadable. I\'ve also incorporated country flags with the progress bar.\n\n\n**Constructing Final Components**\n\nI\'m now putting the finishing touches on the dashboard. I\'m focusing on the bottom-right card, \"Total Customers,\" which will showcase a stat of 2,420 with a 25% increase and include avatar previews of partners and a \"Show All\" interactive element. I\'m also adding an \"Active Live Widgets\" preview section and a quick connect publisher key generator. Finally, I\'m ensuring all pages and components have the new, clean aesthetic.\n\n\n"
