  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the View**\n\nI\'m currently focusing on `PublisherDashboard.tsx`, the main view tied to the reference image. I\'ve begun to break down the elements, starting with the \"Followers & Likes (Metric Stack)\" card. I\'ve noted the top item as a rounded square, and am working my way through each visual component.\n\n\n**Deconstructing the Dashboard**\n\nI\'ve moved on from the \"Metric Stack\" card to the CTR section. I\'m noting the title, the presence of a \"More\" icon, and the main value display (2,420 or 4.8% CTR). Also, the growth indicator (\342\206\221 28%) is important. I\'m focusing on the bar chart, with its 7 columns representing months like Jan, Mar, and so on, but I\'ll need to figure out the corresponding values represented by the chart columns.\n\n\n**Examining the Chart**\n\nI\'m now diving into the \"Audience Growth\" card. I\'ve noted the filter pill toggle with `Today`, `This Week`, and `This Year` options. Specifically, the \"This Year\" pill is highlighted, I have the color, it\'s a bright lime-yellow background with dark text. Also, I\'m analyzing the smooth, curved line chart and taking notes on the Y-axis scale, bezier wave, gradient fill, and interactive tooltip, including its pinned position at the peak and a dashed guide to the March label.\n\n\n**Mapping the Locations**\n\nI\'m now examining the \"Audience Location\" card, which is a wide card on the bottom left. I\'ve noted the \"Export Report \342\206\223\" button. The key feature is a high-detail SVG World Map, with distinct coloring for United States/Canada, Ukraine/Western Europe, and Australia. I\'m also cataloging the hover tooltips on countries with player count and syndication reach. On the right, I\'m noting the \"Top Countries\" list with flags, country names, horizontal progress bars, and percentages for the top five countries. I\'ll need to link these country-specific data points to actual numbers later.\n\n\n**Assessing the Gauge**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the sentiment analysis section. I\'ve noted a semi-circular radial gauge with colored tick segments ranging from red to green, along with a sad and happy emoji on each side, respectively. A big score of 4.85 sits centrally, with a positive status pill beneath.\n\n**Counting Customer Details**\n\nI have analyzed the total customer card with the big value of 2,420, an increase badge of 25%, and a row of four overlapping circular avatars. A link to \"Show All \342\206\222\" which will lead to a modal is also available.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 38
      nanos: 172182824
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
