  planner_response {
    response: "The entire platform has been rebuilt to match the modern light SaaS aesthetic from the reference design while preserving all underlying features and workflows:\n\n### Design & Architecture Highlights\n- **Design System & Palette**: Rebuilt with a light canvas (`#F0F4F8`), pure white cards (`#FFFFFF`), subtle slate borders (`#E2E8F0` / `#F1F5F9`), vibrant blue primary actions (`#2563EB`), and signature lime accents (`#D4F826`).\n- **TrendTide Navigation Header**: Features the modern geometric brand logo mark, active role switcher pill (`Publisher Portal`, `Game Developer`, `QA Admin Console`), the segmented navigation island, quick search drawer, and notification center triggers.\n- **Publisher Suite**:\n  - **Overview Dashboard**: High-level KPI metric cards (Total Impressions, Game Starts, Active Widgets, Live Properties), live game syndication feed, and instant widget builder CTA.\n  - **Widget Builder**: 3-step configuration deck with placement slots (`Header`, `In-Content`, `Sidebar`, `Below Content`, `Custom DOM`), live interactive preview with size preset scale tools, and embed snippet generators.\n  - **My Widgets**: Clean grid with live/paused status toggles, performance metrics, preview links, and embed snippet extraction.\n  - **Branded Game Hubs**: Custom subdomain configuration, branding customization, live game feed pairing, and DNS verification badges.\n  - **Publisher Analytics**: Dwell time charts, CTR telemetry, and per-property performance breakdowns.\n  - **Connect Property Modal**: Clean domain origin verification, automated publisher key generation, and CORS whitelist management.\n- **Developer Suite**:\n  - **Developer Dashboard**: Studio metrics, portfolio summary, quick submission launcher, and real-time status tracker.\n  - **Game Submission Deck**: Pre-flight automated checks (manifest, WebGL container, orientation locks, CSP), real-time playable sandbox test container, and metadata editor.\n  - **My Games & Studio Profile**: Game versioning, status updates, payout configurations, and team management.\n- **Admin & Moderation Console**:\n  - Automated QA review queue, pre-flight test results, sandbox verification launcher, reviewer feedback log, and emergency take-down controls.\n- **Real-Time Distribution & Tools**:\n  - **File & Build Sharing Network**: Peer-to-peer WebSocket asset distribution with SHA-256 validation and interactive build review threads.\n  - **Live Site Placement Simulation**: Multi-device viewport emulator (`Desktop`, `Tablet`, `Mobile`) with screenshot overlay support.\n  - **Playable Game Sandbox Modal & Notification Center**: In-browser playable games and system security audit notifications."
    modified_response: "The entire platform has been rebuilt to match the modern light SaaS aesthetic from the reference design while preserving all underlying features and workflows:\n\n### Design & Architecture Highlights\n- **Design System & Palette**: Rebuilt with a light canvas (`#F0F4F8`), pure white cards (`#FFFFFF`), subtle slate borders (`#E2E8F0` / `#F1F5F9`), vibrant blue primary actions (`#2563EB`), and signature lime accents (`#D4F826`).\n- **TrendTide Navigation Header**: Features the modern geometric brand logo mark, active role switcher pill (`Publisher Portal`, `Game Developer`, `QA Admin Console`), the segmented navigation island, quick search drawer, and notification center triggers.\n- **Publisher Suite**:\n  - **Overview Dashboard**: High-level KPI metric cards (Total Impressions, Game Starts, Active Widgets, Live Properties), live game syndication feed, and instant widget builder CTA.\n  - **Widget Builder**: 3-step configuration deck with placement slots (`Header`, `In-Content`, `Sidebar`, `Below Content`, `Custom DOM`), live interactive preview with size preset scale tools, and embed snippet generators.\n  - **My Widgets**: Clean grid with live/paused status toggles, performance metrics, preview links, and embed snippet extraction.\n  - **Branded Game Hubs**: Custom subdomain configuration, branding customization, live game feed pairing, and DNS verification badges.\n  - **Publisher Analytics**: Dwell time charts, CTR telemetry, and per-property performance breakdowns.\n  - **Connect Property Modal**: Clean domain origin verification, automated publisher key generation, and CORS whitelist management.\n- **Developer Suite**:\n  - **Developer Dashboard**: Studio metrics, portfolio summary, quick submission launcher, and real-time status tracker.\n  - **Game Submission Deck**: Pre-flight automated checks (manifest, WebGL container, orientation locks, CSP), real-time playable sandbox test container, and metadata editor.\n  - **My Games & Studio P